	5. Verify the domain on external CTI tools like Virus Total/Abuse IPDB/Talos, etc. 
	6. Verify the Sender IP on external CTI tools like Virus Total/Abuse IPDB/Talos, etc. 
	7. Detonate suspicious attachment in external CTI Tools like Virus Total/Any Run, etc. 
