Steps for Mitigation: 
	1. Block the identified malicious IP address through Firewall and Email Security - so we do not receive further phishing emails from the same IP address. 
	2. Block the identified malicious Domain address through Firewall and Email Security - so we do not receive further phishing emails from the same Domain address. 
	3. Block the hashes on Endpoint Detection and Response systems to detect and stop any/all executions of the malicious attachments. 
